# The Expert two-stream route of Chieftains' Pyre in co-op (designer D9b; recorded from build/d9b/bot_w9_l3_coop.gd,
# P1|P2): both climb (P2 a step behind), P1 opens the chieftains' tent (Cave Painting 16) while P2 keeps watch, both
# go up the chimney into the pyre hall; each hero fights with enemies-C's club pilot: when a chieftain is an egg the
# hero nearer to it smashes it while the other keeps the surviving chieftain busy within 64 px (B.6), then P1 takes
# the Great Roast. Both heroes give input all the time (a waiting role taps Down; no 243 quiet ticks). Club only.
# Re-recorded in wf10 (bosses) with the same bot after the boss balance of the co-op pair: 5 pips each, both reel
# 110 ticks after a counted hit on either, and they crow 330 ticks after a blow of theirs lands (Chieftain.COOP_*);
# fight 45-90 s and at most 6 hurts on this Expert route.
